    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ALERT - ALERT - ALERT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive, unknown, hostile, <strong>fae-type entities</strong> are coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To defeat a &quot;fairy&quot;, you have to learn the rune corresponding to its name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To defeat a fae kaiju, you write the rune across entire city blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sayonara Sigil Sentry</strong> is a short boss rush game merging bullet hell with &quot;connect the dots&quot;. No longer will you be able to idle in a safe spot shooting the enemy. You will have to keep moving to draw the indicated rune, while your bizarre adversaries keep evolving with every completed rune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioning and quick thinking will be integral to your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face 10 bosses with unique patterns each.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a strange analog horror-inspired story about Celtic runes, poorly-interpreted Costa Rican folklore and the evils of big tech companies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting ambient soundtrack created by Unoperator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock alternative color palettes by playing previous ApeHardware games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All for the price of 0\u20ac.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
